xcuserdata
!src/**/build/
local.properties
.signing/
*.jks
*.keystore
# Deliberately tracked. Not a secret: it signs debug builds only, and it is committed
# precisely so every debug APK shares one signature - otherwise the in-app debug update
# line cannot install over an existing debug install and every build means an uninstall.
# The release keystore is still excluded by the rule above and must never be committed.
!androidApp/nuvio-debug.keystore
*.apk
*.aab
.android-sdk/
.tmp-gh/
.idea
.DS_Store
captures
.externalNativeBuild
.cxx
*.xcodeproj/*
!*.xcodeproj/project.pbxproj
!*.xcodeproj/xcshareddata/
!*.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/
!*.xcworkspace/contents.xcworkspacedata
**/xcshareddata/WorkspaceSettings.xcsettings
node_modules/
logs/
analysis/
# Docs/ carries the canonical Nuvio Z documents and must be tracked.
# Only the untracked reference material inside it is ignored.
Docs/Stremio addons refer/
keystore/
scripts/build-distribution.sh
asset
scripts/scrape_android_compose_animation_docs.py
tools
PERFORMANCE_FINDINGS.md

